  "body": "For the encoding spec, I'd like to be able to write `ReadableStream<USVString>` to indicate a readable that vends string chunks, and `WritableStream<BufferSource>` to indicate a writable that accepts chunks consisting of [buffers of data](https://www.w3.org/TR/WebIDL-1/#es-buffer-source-types).\r\n\r\nBut this doesn't work. Should it?",
